# Fatehold Charm's third mode: "Creatures you control get +1/+2 until end of turn." Bot1's Llanowar Elves becomes 2/3 and
# Bot2's stays 1/1 (only "you control"). The Ornithopter cast after the charm resolved is not affected: the set of creatures
# is fixed as the effect begins (CR 611.2c). Next turn the Elves are 1/1 again (CR 514.2).

